<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We tried to read the RSS feed of <strong><%= @title %></strong> <%= @failures %> times in a row and couldn't: <%= catalog_error_label(@podcast.last_error) %>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your page on <%= APP_NAME %> stays listed for brands, with a note that it may be out of date until we can read the feed again. New episodes and sponsor reads won't show until then.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Check that this address opens your feed in a browser: <span style="word-break:break-all;"><%= @podcast.feed_url %></span>. If your feed moved, add the new address to your host's settings, or write to us at hello@midrolo.com.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">We'll keep trying on our own.</p>
<%= mail_button "Open your page", podcast_url(@podcast) %>
<%= mail_footnote "We send this once when we can't read a show you manage several times in a row." %>
